// {{gfwpro_token}}

### Create a new API Key
POST https://localhost:8443/api/profile/api-keys
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

{
  "organizationId": 1,
  "userId": 3
}

### Get a list of API Tokens for an organization
GET https://localhost:8443/api/profile/api-keys/75
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### get the invitations sent by the actual user
DELETE https://localhost:8443/api/profile/api-keys/1/sadsadsad
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}


